{"type":"system","subtype":"task_summary","detail":"Writing styles.css","uuid":"7c5e2ec0-5f98-4cf4-8e19-588ea4bf2850","session_id":"07ffc9d3-3f4a-4aca-8bb6-4fc98bb56e8c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ9GKR4MeD5MZpqFzDWC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QEZAaAEJAFuuJUodsjzSe4","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-019-xnLe6J/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>用户服务 API 文档</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n  <nav>\n    <div class=\"brand\">用户服务 API <small style=\"color:var(--muted);font-weight:400\">v1</small></div>\n    <h4>入门</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"#overview\">概述</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#auth\">鉴权方式</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#errors\">错误码</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <h4>用户接口</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"#list-users\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>用户列表</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#get-user\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>用户详情</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#create-user\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>创建用户</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#update-user\"><span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>更新用户</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main>\n    <section id=\"overview\">\n      <h1>用户服务 API</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">基于 REST 风格的用户管理接口。所有请求与响应均使用 JSON 编码（UTF-8）。</p>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n          <tr><th>项目</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          <tr><td>Base URL</td><td><code>https://api.example.com/v1</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>协议</td><td>仅支持 HTTPS</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Content-Type</td><td><code>application/json</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>时间格式</td><td>ISO 8601，UTC，例如 <code>2026-10-26T08:30:00Z</code></td></tr>\n        </table></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"auth\">\n      <h2>鉴权方式</h2>\n      <p>API 使用 <strong>Bearer Token</strong>（OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials）鉴权。先用 <code>client_id</code> 和 <code>client_secret</code> 换取访问令牌，再在每个请求的 <code>Authorization</code> 头中携带该令牌。</p>\n\n      <h3>1. 获取访问令牌</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>/oauth/token</div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/oauth/token \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"client_id\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_ID\",\n    \"client_secret\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET\",\n    \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n  }'</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"access_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...\",\n  \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"expires_in\": 7200,\n  \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>2. 在请求中携带令牌</h3>\n<pre>Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...</pre>\n\n      <h3>权限范围（scope）</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>Scope</th><th>说明</th><th>适用接口</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>users:read</code></td><td>读取用户信息</td><td>用户列表、用户详情</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>users:write</code></td><td>创建与修改用户</td><td>创建用户、更新用户</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        令牌有效期为 <code>expires_in</code> 秒（默认 2 小时）。过期后接口返回 <span class=\"status\">401</span>，请重新获取令牌。<br>\n        <code>client_secret</code> 只能保存在服务端，切勿写入前端代码或移动端安装包。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"errors\">\n      <h2>错误码</h2>\n      <p>出错时返回对应的 HTTP 状态码，响应体格式统一：</p>\n<pre>{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"validation_failed\",\n    \"message\": \"email 格式不正确\",\n    \"request_id\": \"req_8f2a1c\"\n  }\n}</pre>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>状态码</th><th>code</th><th>含义</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">400</td><td><code>bad_request</code></td><td>请求格式错误</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">401</td><td><code>unauthorized</code></td><td>未携带令牌，或令牌无效 / 已过期</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">403</td><td><code>forbidden</code></td><td>令牌缺少所需 scope</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">404</td><td><code>not_found</code></td><td>资源不存在</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">409</td><td><code>conflict</code></td><td>资源冲突（如邮箱已被注册）</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">422</td><td><code>validation_failed</code></td><td>字段校验失败</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">429</td><td><code>rate_limited</code></td><td>请求过于频繁，参考 <code>Retry-After</code> 响应头</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">500</td><td><code>internal_error</code></td><td>服务端错误，请附上 <code>request_id</code> 联系我们</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <h2>用户接口</h2>\n    <p>用户对象字段：</p>\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n      <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>id</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户唯一 ID，以 <code>usr_</code> 开头</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户名称</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>邮箱，全局唯一</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>admin</code> | <code>member</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>active</code> | <code>disabled</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>created_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>创建时间</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>updated_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>最后更新时间</td></tr>\n    </table></div>\n\n    <section id=\"list-users\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">获取用户列表</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>/users</div>\n      <p>分页返回用户列表。需要 scope：<code>users:read</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Query 参数</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>page</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>integer</td><td>页码，从 1 开始，默认 1</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>page_size</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>integer</td><td>每页条数，1–100，默认 20</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>status</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>string</td><td>按状态筛选：<code>active</code> / <code>disabled</code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>q</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>string</td><td>按名称或邮箱模糊搜索</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl \"https://api.example.com/v1/users?page=1&amp;page_size=2\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"usr_1001\",\n      \"name\": \"张三\",\n      \"email\": \"zhangsan@example.com\",\n      \"role\": \"admin\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-01-12T03:20:00Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-01T10:00:00Z\"\n    },\n    { \"id\": \"usr_1002\", \"...\": \"...\" }\n  ],\n  \"pagination\": {\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"page_size\": 2,\n    \"total\": 57\n  }\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"get-user\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">获取用户详情</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>/users/{id}</div>\n      <p>根据 ID 获取单个用户。需要 scope：<code>users:read</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Path 参数</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>id</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>用户 ID</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_1001 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_1001\",\n  \"name\": \"张三\",\n  \"email\": \"zhangsan@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-01-12T03:20:00Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-01T10:00:00Z\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>可能的错误：<span class=\"status\">404</span> 用户不存在。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"create-user\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">创建用户</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>/users</div>\n      <p>创建新用户。需要 scope：<code>users:write</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Body 参数</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>name</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>1–64 个字符</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>email</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>合法邮箱，不能与已有用户重复</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>password</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>至少 8 位，需包含字母和数字；不会在响应中返回</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>role</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>string</td><td>默认 <code>member</code></td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/users \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"name\": \"李四\",\n    \"email\": \"lisi@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"s3cretPass\",\n    \"role\": \"member\"\n  }'</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 201</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_1058\",\n  \"name\": \"李四\",\n  \"email\": \"lisi@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:30:00Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:30:00Z\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>可能的错误：<span class=\"status\">409</span> 邮箱已存在；<span class=\"status\">422</span> 字段校验失败。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"update-user\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">更新用户</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>/users/{id}</div>\n      <p>部分更新用户信息，只需传入要修改的字段。需要 scope：<code>users:write</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Body 参数（均为可选，至少传一个）</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>1–64 个字符</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>新邮箱，不能与已有用户重复</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>admin</code> | <code>member</code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td>设为 <code>disabled</code> 可停用用户</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl -X PATCH https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_1058 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{ \"role\": \"admin\" }'</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_1058\",\n  \"name\": \"李四\",\n  \"email\": \"lisi@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:30:00Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T09:12:45Z\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>可能的错误：<span class=\"status\">404</span> 用户不存在；<span class=\"status\">409</span> 邮箱冲突；<span class=\"status\">422</span> 字段校验失败。</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2937,"cache_read_input_tokens":34024,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2937},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07ffc9d3-3f4a-4aca-8bb6-4fc98bb56e8c","uuid":"de5d9571-7849-44a9-a768-e7c14dabab18","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:32:34.312Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ9GK9CMLLXKutVzjU3E","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01QEZAaAEJAFuuJUodsjzSe4":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-019-xnLe6J/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>用户服务 API 文档</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n  <nav>\n    <div class=\"brand\">用户服务 API <small style=\"color:var(--muted);font-weight:400\">v1</small></div>\n    <h4>入门</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"#overview\">概述</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#auth\">鉴权方式</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#errors\">错误码</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <h4>用户接口</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"#list-users\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>用户列表</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#get-user\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>用户详情</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#create-user\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>创建用户</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#update-user\"><span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>更新用户</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main>\n    <section id=\"overview\">\n      <h1>用户服务 API</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">基于 REST 风格的用户管理接口。所有请求与响应均使用 JSON 编码（UTF-8）。</p>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n          <tr><th>项目</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          <tr><td>Base URL</td><td><code>https://api.example.com/v1</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>协议</td><td>仅支持 HTTPS</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Content-Type</td><td><code>application/json</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>时间格式</td><td>ISO 8601，UTC，例如 <code>2026-10-26T08:30:00Z</code></td></tr>\n        </table></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"auth\">\n      <h2>鉴权方式</h2>\n      <p>API 使用 <strong>Bearer Token</strong>（OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials）鉴权。先用 <code>client_id</code> 和 <code>client_secret</code> 换取访问令牌，再在每个请求的 <code>Authorization</code> 头中携带该令牌。</p>\n\n      <h3>1. 获取访问令牌</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>/oauth/token</div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/oauth/token \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"client_id\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_ID\",\n    \"client_secret\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET\",\n    \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n  }'</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"access_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...\",\n  \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"expires_in\": 7200,\n  \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>2. 在请求中携带令牌</h3>\n<pre>Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...</pre>\n\n      <h3>权限范围（scope）</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>Scope</th><th>说明</th><th>适用接口</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>users:read</code></td><td>读取用户信息</td><td>用户列表、用户详情</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>users:write</code></td><td>创建与修改用户</td><td>创建用户、更新用户</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        令牌有效期为 <code>expires_in</code> 秒（默认 2 小时）。过期后接口返回 <span class=\"status\">401</span>，请重新获取令牌。<br>\n        <code>client_secret</code> 只能保存在服务端，切勿写入前端代码或移动端安装包。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"errors\">\n      <h2>错误码</h2>\n      <p>出错时返回对应的 HTTP 状态码，响应体格式统一：</p>\n<pre>{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"validation_failed\",\n    \"message\": \"email 格式不正确\",\n    \"request_id\": \"req_8f2a1c\"\n  }\n}</pre>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>状态码</th><th>code</th><th>含义</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">400</td><td><code>bad_request</code></td><td>请求格式错误</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">401</td><td><code>unauthorized</code></td><td>未携带令牌，或令牌无效 / 已过期</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">403</td><td><code>forbidden</code></td><td>令牌缺少所需 scope</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">404</td><td><code>not_found</code></td><td>资源不存在</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">409</td><td><code>conflict</code></td><td>资源冲突（如邮箱已被注册）</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">422</td><td><code>validation_failed</code></td><td>字段校验失败</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">429</td><td><code>rate_limited</code></td><td>请求过于频繁，参考 <code>Retry-After</code> 响应头</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">500</td><td><code>internal_error</code></td><td>服务端错误，请附上 <code>request_id</code> 联系我们</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <h2>用户接口</h2>\n    <p>用户对象字段：</p>\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n      <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>id</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户唯一 ID，以 <code>usr_</code> 开头</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户名称</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>邮箱，全局唯一</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>admin</code> | <code>member</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>active</code> | <code>disabled</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>created_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>创建时间</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>updated_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>最后更新时间</td></tr>\n    </table></div>\n\n    <section id=\"list-users\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">获取用户列表</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>/users</div>\n      <p>分页返回用户列表。需要 scope：<code>users:read</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Query 参数</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>page</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>integer</td><td>页码，从 1 开始，默认 1</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>page_size</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>integer</td><td>每页条数，1–100，默认 20</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>status</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>string</td><td>按状态筛选：<code>active</code> / <code>disabled</code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>q</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>string</td><td>按名称或邮箱模糊搜索</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl \"https://api.example.com/v1/users?page=1&amp;page_size=2\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"usr_1001\",\n      \"name\": \"张三\",\n      \"email\": \"zhangsan@example.com\",\n      \"role\": \"admin\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-01-12T03:20:00Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-01T10:00:00Z\"\n    },\n    { \"id\": \"usr_1002\", \"...\": \"...\" }\n  ],\n  \"pagination\": {\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"page_size\": 2,\n    \"total\": 57\n  }\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"get-user\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">获取用户详情</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>/users/{id}</div>\n      <p>根据 ID 获取单个用户。需要 scope：<code>users:read</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Path 参数</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>id</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>用户 ID</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_1001 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_1001\",\n  \"name\": \"张三\",\n  \"email\": \"zhangsan@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-01-12T03:20:00Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-01T10:00:00Z\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>可能的错误：<span class=\"status\">404</span> 用户不存在。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"create-user\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">创建用户</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>/users</div>\n      <p>创建新用户。需要 scope：<code>users:write</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Body 参数</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>name</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>1–64 个字符</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>email</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>合法邮箱，不能与已有用户重复</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>password</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>至少 8 位，需包含字母和数字；不会在响应中返回</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>role</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>string</td><td>默认 <code>member</code></td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/users \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"name\": \"李四\",\n    \"email\": \"lisi@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"s3cretPass\",\n    \"role\": \"member\"\n  }'</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 201</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_1058\",\n  \"name\": \"李四\",\n  \"email\": \"lisi@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:30:00Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:30:00Z\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>可能的错误：<span class=\"status\">409</span> 邮箱已存在；<span class=\"status\">422</span> 字段校验失败。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"update-user\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">更新用户</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>/users/{id}</div>\n      <p>部分更新用户信息，只需传入要修改的字段。需要 scope：<code>users:write</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Body 参数（均为可选，至少传一个）</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>1–64 个字符</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>新邮箱，不能与已有用户重复</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>admin</code> | <code>member</code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td>设为 <code>disabled</code> 可停用用户</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl -X PATCH https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_1058 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{ \"role\": \"admin\" }'</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_1058\",\n  \"name\": \"李四\",\n  \"email\": \"lisi@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:30:00Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T09:12:45Z\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>可能的错误：<span class=\"status\">404</span> 用户不存在；<span class=\"status\">409</span> 邮箱冲突；<span class=\"status\">422</span> 字段校验失败。</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QEZAaAEJAFuuJUodsjzSe4","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-019-xnLe6J/index.html (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07ffc9d3-3f4a-4aca-8bb6-4fc98bb56e8c","uuid":"03f6e6d2-1904-4675-8b22-23b9ed5930ba","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:32:34.321Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-019-xnLe6J/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>用户服务 API 文档</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n  <nav>\n    <div class=\"brand\">用户服务 API <small style=\"color:var(--muted);font-weight:400\">v1</small></div>\n    <h4>入门</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"#overview\">概述</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#auth\">鉴权方式</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#errors\">错误码</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <h4>用户接口</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"#list-users\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>用户列表</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#get-user\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>用户详情</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#create-user\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>创建用户</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#update-user\"><span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>更新用户</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main>\n    <section id=\"overview\">\n      <h1>用户服务 API</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">基于 REST 风格的用户管理接口。所有请求与响应均使用 JSON 编码（UTF-8）。</p>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n          <tr><th>项目</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          <tr><td>Base URL</td><td><code>https://api.example.com/v1</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>协议</td><td>仅支持 HTTPS</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Content-Type</td><td><code>application/json</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>时间格式</td><td>ISO 8601，UTC，例如 <code>2026-10-26T08:30:00Z</code></td></tr>\n        </table></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"auth\">\n      <h2>鉴权方式</h2>\n      <p>API 使用 <strong>Bearer Token</strong>（OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials）鉴权。先用 <code>client_id</code> 和 <code>client_secret</code> 换取访问令牌，再在每个请求的 <code>Authorization</code> 头中携带该令牌。</p>\n\n      <h3>1. 获取访问令牌</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>/oauth/token</div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/oauth/token \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"client_id\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_ID\",\n    \"client_secret\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET\",\n    \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n  }'</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"access_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...\",\n  \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"expires_in\": 7200,\n  \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>2. 在请求中携带令牌</h3>\n<pre>Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...</pre>\n\n      <h3>权限范围（scope）</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>Scope</th><th>说明</th><th>适用接口</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>users:read</code></td><td>读取用户信息</td><td>用户列表、用户详情</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>users:write</code></td><td>创建与修改用户</td><td>创建用户、更新用户</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        令牌有效期为 <code>expires_in</code> 秒（默认 2 小时）。过期后接口返回 <span class=\"status\">401</span>，请重新获取令牌。<br>\n        <code>client_secret</code> 只能保存在服务端，切勿写入前端代码或移动端安装包。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"errors\">\n      <h2>错误码</h2>\n      <p>出错时返回对应的 HTTP 状态码，响应体格式统一：</p>\n<pre>{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"validation_failed\",\n    \"message\": \"email 格式不正确\",\n    \"request_id\": \"req_8f2a1c\"\n  }\n}</pre>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>状态码</th><th>code</th><th>含义</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">400</td><td><code>bad_request</code></td><td>请求格式错误</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">401</td><td><code>unauthorized</code></td><td>未携带令牌，或令牌无效 / 已过期</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">403</td><td><code>forbidden</code></td><td>令牌缺少所需 scope</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">404</td><td><code>not_found</code></td><td>资源不存在</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">409</td><td><code>conflict</code></td><td>资源冲突（如邮箱已被注册）</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">422</td><td><code>validation_failed</code></td><td>字段校验失败</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">429</td><td><code>rate_limited</code></td><td>请求过于频繁，参考 <code>Retry-After</code> 响应头</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"status\">500</td><td><code>internal_error</code></td><td>服务端错误，请附上 <code>request_id</code> 联系我们</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <h2>用户接口</h2>\n    <p>用户对象字段：</p>\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n      <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>id</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户唯一 ID，以 <code>usr_</code> 开头</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户名称</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>邮箱，全局唯一</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>admin</code> | <code>member</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>active</code> | <code>disabled</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>created_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>创建时间</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>updated_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>最后更新时间</td></tr>\n    </table></div>\n\n    <section id=\"list-users\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">获取用户列表</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>/users</div>\n      <p>分页返回用户列表。需要 scope：<code>users:read</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Query 参数</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>page</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>integer</td><td>页码，从 1 开始，默认 1</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>page_size</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>integer</td><td>每页条数，1–100，默认 20</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>status</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>string</td><td>按状态筛选：<code>active</code> / <code>disabled</code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>q</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>string</td><td>按名称或邮箱模糊搜索</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl \"https://api.example.com/v1/users?page=1&amp;page_size=2\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"usr_1001\",\n      \"name\": \"张三\",\n      \"email\": \"zhangsan@example.com\",\n      \"role\": \"admin\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-01-12T03:20:00Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-01T10:00:00Z\"\n    },\n    { \"id\": \"usr_1002\", \"...\": \"...\" }\n  ],\n  \"pagination\": {\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"page_size\": 2,\n    \"total\": 57\n  }\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"get-user\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">获取用户详情</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>/users/{id}</div>\n      <p>根据 ID 获取单个用户。需要 scope：<code>users:read</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Path 参数</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>id</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>用户 ID</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_1001 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_1001\",\n  \"name\": \"张三\",\n  \"email\": \"zhangsan@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-01-12T03:20:00Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-01T10:00:00Z\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>可能的错误：<span class=\"status\">404</span> 用户不存在。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"create-user\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">创建用户</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>/users</div>\n      <p>创建新用户。需要 scope：<code>users:write</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Body 参数</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>name</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>1–64 个字符</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>email</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>合法邮箱，不能与已有用户重复</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>password</code> <span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>string</td><td>至少 8 位，需包含字母和数字；不会在响应中返回</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>role</code> <span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>string</td><td>默认 <code>member</code></td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/users \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"name\": \"李四\",\n    \"email\": \"lisi@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"s3cretPass\",\n    \"role\": \"member\"\n  }'</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 201</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_1058\",\n  \"name\": \"李四\",\n  \"email\": \"lisi@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:30:00Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:30:00Z\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>可能的错误：<span class=\"status\">409</span> 邮箱已存在；<span class=\"status\">422</span> 字段校验失败。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"update-user\" class=\"card\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">更新用户</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\"><span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>/users/{id}</div>\n      <p>部分更新用户信息，只需传入要修改的字段。需要 scope：<code>users:write</code></p>\n      <div class=\"label\">Body 参数（均为可选，至少传一个）</div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n        <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>1–64 个字符</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>新邮箱，不能与已有用户重复</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>admin</code> | <code>member</code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td>设为 <code>disabled</code> 可停用用户</td></tr>\n      </table></div>\n      <div class=\"examples\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">请求</div>\n<pre>curl -X PATCH https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_1058 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{ \"role\": \"admin\" }'</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"label\">响应 200</div>\n<pre>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_1058\",\n  \"name\": \"李四\",\n  \"email\": \"lisi@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:30:00Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T09:12:45Z\"\n}</pre>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>可能的错误：<span class=\"status\">404</span> 用户不存在；<span class=\"status\">409</span> 邮箱冲突；<span class=\"status\">422</span> 字段校验失败。</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QEZAaAEJAFuuJUodsjzSe4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
